  17:56:40.466  gavia   48099 nikhilkunapareddy   14u  IPv4 0x411e320743fc7494      0t0  TCP 10.0.0.102:60795->140.82.114.4:443 (ESTABLISHED)

## who 140.82.114.4 is
  gh api meta -> GitHub web/api range: 140.82.112.0/20
  updater endpoint (tauri.conf.json @ v0.3.1): https://github.com/nikhil-kunapareddy/gavia/releases/latest/download/latest.json

## result
  one TCP connection, to GitHub :443, seen only in the samples at launch (the update check).
  no socket at all in any sample while the 25 photos were checked, or afterwards.
  limit: a socket opened and closed between two samples (~0.3 s) would not be seen.
  samples taken while the photos were checked (17:57:06–17:57:10 UTC): 14, all empty.
